!! cmavo: nai (NAI)

!!! Proposed Definition
Negate cmavo. Causes the meaning of the attached cmavo to be the negative of the original meaning.

!!! Proposed Tag

!!! See Also
* na

!!! Proposed Keywords
* negate
* negative

!!! Usage Examples
;.i.ienai mi na blanu:"[[[Disagreement] I am not blue."

;.i.uinaicai lo mi gerku cu morsi:"[[[Extreme unhappiness] My dog is dead!"

!!! Notes


!!! Issues

{BOX}

!! General Section Issues

All attitudinal modifiers are weird. (zo'o)